  "details": "I’m WD-ON and have a few Contact systems. Some are set up by default with the Sender/Receiver not touching—value of 0–while others are set up with the Sender/Receiver pair superimposed, for a default value of 1.\nWhen the avatar is freshly reset, there’s no problem. Everything works perfectly (even getting in and out of stations, which used to be a problem!). However, when I change worlds, all my Contact systems that are 1 by default get stuck (iirc they get stuck at 1, but they definitely get stuck). The ones that were 0 by default are fine, they keep working.\nPlease fix this so I don’t have to figure out some crazy hacky way to arrange my affected Contact systems so they’re 0 at default instead. They really will not work as well that way around x(",
